{
  "declaredLength": 6816,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Qué coincidencia encontrarte por aquí,\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD0600000051007500E900200063006F0069006E0063006900640065006E00630069006100200065006E0063006F006E00740072006100720074006500200070006F0072002000610071007500ED002C000A0010000201000000002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vas a poder asistir a una negociación, si así lo\ndeseas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006100730020006100200070006F006400650072002000610073006900730074006900720020006100200075006E00610020006E00650067006F0063006900610063006900F3006E002C00200073006900200061007300ED0020006C006F000A006400650073006500610073002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ya estamos aquí.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006100200065007300740061006D006F0073002000610071007500ED002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vayamos directos al grano.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006100790061006D006F00730020006400690072006500630074006F007300200061006C0020006700720061006E006F002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Creemos que Quastelar S. A. no contribuye lo\nsuficiente para cubrir los gastos de la<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ninvestigación en Luminalia Dimensional.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 132
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Nos regimos por el acuerdo inicial. Además,\nhemos provisto de equipo a la investigación.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "El desarrollo de dicho equipo supone un gasto\npara nosotros también.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006C0020006400650073006100720072006F006C006C006F00200064006500200064006900630068006F002000650071007500690070006F0020007300750070006F006E006500200075006E00200067006100730074006F000A00700061007200610020006E006F0073006F00740072006F0073002000740061006D0062006900E9006E002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Somos plenamente conscientes de ello.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSin embargo, la escala de la investigación es\nmayor de lo previsto. El personal está agotado y<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nel coste de la operación se ha vuelto insostenible.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 195
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué menos que un pequeño aumento de sueldo\npara nuestra exhausta plantilla?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Una revisión del presupuesto a estas alturas\nllevará su tiempo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E0061002000720065007600690073006900F3006E002000640065006C00200070007200650073007500700075006500730074006F0020006100200065007300740061007300200061006C00740075007200610073000A006C006C006500760061007200E10020007300750020007400690065006D0070006F002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lo entendemos. La responsabilidad del desarrollo\nurbanístico recae en vuestras manos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sin embargo, nuestras investigaciones son de\nsuma importancia para el desarrollo de la ciudad.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ambos trabajamos por el bien de la ciudad, pero,\nde seguir así, nuestro esfuerzo será en vano.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Y si resolvemos el asunto con un combate?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00590020007300690020007200650073006F006C00760065006D006F007300200065006C0020006100730075006E0074006F00200063006F006E00200075006E00200063006F006D0062006100740065003F00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me parece razonable.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEn ese caso, me tomaré la libertad de nombrar\na <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> como mi asociad<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "De acuerdo",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004400650020006100630075006500720064006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Quéee?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E900650065003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No podemos hacer esperar a don Córax cuando\nse trata de negocios.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F00200070006F00640065006D006F0073002000680061006300650072002000650073007000650072006100720020006100200064006F006E0020004300F30072006100780020006300750061006E0064006F000A007300650020007400720061007400610020006400650020006E00650067006F00630069006F0073002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bien. Me estoy jugando mucho en esto.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 3080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200690065006E002E0020004D00650020006500730074006F00790020006A007500670061006E0064006F0020006D007500630068006F00200065006E0020006500730074006F002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Solo veo una forma de zanjar este asunto con\nAirén! ¡Un combate!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10053006F006C006F002000760065006F00200075006E006100200066006F0072006D00610020006400650020007A0061006E006A00610072002000650073007400650020006100730075006E0074006F00200063006F006E000A00410069007200E9006E0021002000A10055006E00200063006F006D0062006100740065002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Haré cuanto esté en mi mano para que don Córax\nmantenga su honor intacto.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Hora de combatir!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10048006F0072006100200064006500200063006F006D0062006100740069007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un momento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Arreando, que es gerundio.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410072007200650061006E0064006F002C002000710075006500200065007300200067006500720075006E00640069006F002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Hay cosas que no se resuelven con palabras\nbonitas!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100480061007900200063006F00730061007300200071007500650020006E006F002000730065002000720065007300750065006C00760065006E00200063006F006E002000700061006C00610062007200610073000A0062006F006E0069007400610073002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En el Clan Corrosión estamos orgullosos de crear\npuestos de trabajo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E00200065006C00200043006C0061006E00200043006F00720072006F0073006900F3006E00200065007300740061006D006F00730020006F007200670075006C006C006F0073006F0073002000640065002000630072006500610072000A00700075006500730074006F0073002000640065002000740072006100620061006A006F002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No te lo pondré fácil. Dejarme vencer arrastraría\npor el fango la reputación de don Córax.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mejor no hacer esperar a don Córax. Debemos\ncombatir de inmediato.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065006A006F00720020006E006F002000680061006300650072002000650073007000650072006100720020006100200064006F006E0020004300F3007200610078002E00200044006500620065006D006F0073000A0063006F006D0062006100740069007200200064006500200069006E006D00650064006900610074006F002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Scolipede! ¡Contigo a mi lado puedo seguir\nsonriendo aunque esté entre la espada y la pared!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La megaevolución refleja el lazo que nos une...\n¡Admirad la verdadera belleza de mi Skarmory!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Drampa y yo somos uno! ¡Os mostraremos\nel valor real de la megaevolución!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Impresionante. De no haber sido por ti, habría\nperdido, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006D00700072006500730069006F006E0061006E00740065002E0020004400650020006E006F0020006800610062006500720020007300690064006F00200070006F0072002000740069002C0020006800610062007200ED0061000A007000650072006400690064006F002C00200010000201000000002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Una derrota es una derrota! De momento,\nla financiación se quedará como está.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Habrá que apretarse el cinturón. Yo contribuiré\nrecortando mis dietas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y yo me comprometo a una revisión urgente del\npresupuesto para aliviaros la carga.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por ahora, me encargaré personalmente de cubrir\nlos gastos adicionales del clan.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, aquí tienes tu paga extra!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10010000201000000002C002000610071007500ED0020007400690065006E0065007300200074007500200070006100670061002000650078007400720061002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Has recibido el Traje de Córax de color alternativo.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480061007300200072006500630069006200690064006F00200065006C0020005400720061006A00650020006400650020004300F300720061007800200064006500200063006F006C006F007200200061006C007400650072006E0061007400690076006F002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dicen que ahora puedes pedir que te hagan un\npeinado como el mío en cualquier peluquería.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Airén, si desarrolláis bien la ciudad, vendrá\nmucha gente a gastarse el dinero. Piénsalo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sin duda. Por eso deseo mantener una excelente\nrelación con el Clan Corrosión.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por mucho que cambie la ciudad en la que crecí,\nmi estilo de vida se mantiene. Eso me gusta.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le debemos todo a esta ciudad, que nos aceptó\na pesar de nuestro turbio pasado.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 6500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La convicción férrea de don Córax me inspira\nconfianza a mí también.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 6668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006100200063006F006E0076006900630063006900F3006E0020006600E9007200720065006100200064006500200064006F006E0020004300F30072006100780020006D006500200069006E00730070006900720061000A0063006F006E006600690061006E007A0061002000610020006D00ED002000740061006D0062006900E9006E002E001000020114000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    }
  ],
